var LDIFF=['Starting and finishing work','Following multi-step instructions','Staying seated and settled','Organising equipment and homework','Waiting for a turn and calling out','Remembering what to bring','Managing friendships'],LADJ=['Seat near the teacher and away from distractions','Short, one-step instructions, checked back','Planned movement breaks','Visual timetable and checklists','Work broken into shorter chunks','Home\u2013school communication book','Extra time or a quiet space for tests (if assessed as needed)'];
